cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "lipid-stability-heatmap: statistics and heatmaps for lipid stability studies"
abstract: >-
  An R pipeline for lipid and metabolite stability studies. Samples stored under
  different temperatures, storage times and freeze-thaw cycles are compared with
  a -80 C / 0 h baseline using log2 fold changes, Kruskal-Wallis and Dunn's
  tests, per lipid and per lipid class, and visualised as multi-panel
  ComplexHeatmap figures.
type: software
